    - Lightpanda (runs JS): first page passed, but Akamai's script throws in it
      and _abck stays "~-1~" - same short-grace outcome expected.
  Edge, a real browser on the same IP and session, kept working throughout.
  Hence: Edge tab by default; `--via http` (curl_cffi when installed) is an
